Date: Sat, 20 Jun 2026 02:46:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix dark mode toggle, mobile layout, and drawer scrolling

- Fix dark mode: JS was toggling light-mode class but CSS uses dark-mode;
  now correctly syncs both classes and defaults to dark on fresh visits
- Update nav dropdown CSS to be light-first with body.dark-mode overrides,
  consistent with style.css architecture
- Add overflow-y scroll + custom scrollbar to mobile drawer sub-menus
  (DevOps/AIOps sections) so all items are reachable on small screens
- Add max-height + overflow scroll to the drawer itself on mobile
- Hide animated terminal box on tablet/phone and center-align hero content
- Remove duplicate #dh-drawer element in index.html

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
